{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:40:634","content":{"id":634,"title":"棒球比赛","content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6562c637-bf24-4c52-a2a1-aca2b0c1d983","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"看一个使用最大流解决实际问题的例子，那就是棒球比赛。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f4108cf9-27ea-4e09-a6cc-73c0bd2b1754","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"全美每年都会举行一次棒球比赛，每个队都要进行 $162$ 场比赛，最终所胜的场次最多的队伍获胜，如果平局就进行加赛。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"283ef7d9-6115-411b-8293-740fbdd6c9da","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是如果在比赛的过程中，某一队已经没有获得冠军的希望了，那么该队就会被直接淘汰。例如 A 队已经赢了 10 场了，而 B 队只赢了 1 场，并且还有 8 场比赛没有打，此时 $B$ 队如何也不能赢的场次比 A 队多，所以 B 队应该被淘汰。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f9a1a88c-507f-415f-a717-4ef1bc31ab1b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"现在我们拿到了 1996 年 8 月 30 日真实的比赛数据，此时只剩下 5 个队"}]},{"type":"table","tauContract":"6b49184b8918108ccf1636963138d105f679894dfe0d7b7abd75a6e6db67056b","collabId":"06aeb438-d799-4263-9196-805d1dc813d4","children":[{"type":"table-row","tauContract":"e0390883f5755ceda18769fa110bf264bee6f2391ac403aab2a5f429a086d8ce","collabId":"dcbe5333-25a8-4ba5-9a02-9344756e9f90","children":[{"type":"table-cell","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","collabId":"989ddc2d-85bf-4c17-ae5f-9d194cdf2bd9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Teams"}]},{"type":"table-cell","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","collabId":"71cf1d46-9ffc-4657-b8eb-6e8c395784df","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Wins"}]},{"type":"table-cell","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","collabId":"cbdb05dd-2f4f-474c-844d-20291e6f5752","childre