"text":"0"}]},{"type":"table-cell","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","collabId":"6ba168c0-8be7-45df-b7c0-81df8c08a261","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"0"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"92772d8d-ab7d-4570-8e06-16d66b3f524f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Wins 代表赢了多少场，Loss 表示输了多少场，Left 表示剩余多少场没有打，Against 后面的 5 列表示与其他队要打多少场。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"edb80966-39fd-4f60-8074-fea56764b13c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当时媒体争议的是最后一个队，即 Detroit 队还有没有获胜的希望。从数据上看，如果 Detroit 剩下的  场全赢，那么它的赢的总场次是 ，比最强的 New York 还多一场，所以它还有赢的机会，但是这样想的话就忽略了一个事实，即使 Detroit 与其他四队的比赛都打赢了，但是这四个队之间还有比赛，也就说说这四个队它们的总胜场是会增加的。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7af3bf4e-e41b-4331-9771-f5a3cd90e1f5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所以现在又变为了这么一个问题，如果前四个队之间比赛，如果最终它们的胜场最多是  的话，说明 Detroit 队还有赢的希望，否则 Detroit 队没有赢的可能。现在我们如下建模"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_43d6468e-4496-4a42-b617-f1d409426fe1.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"fd3a99a7-2bb4-4570-8ac4-f08c7c710447","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a839650b-f822-4b70-8589-37b1f1734d47","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这个图分为三部分，第一部分"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_a6c74abe-6191-4b18-adc9-62b84ad4110e.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"4e27cf27-6b2e-4d9b-8196-c07923c1906c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"02e4f476-6c2a-41b7-9ee9-a0d4122e2406","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"其中权值表示比赛场次，比如 s → NY-Bal 这条边的权值为 5，表示 NY 与 Bal 之间有五场比赛要打，可见这四个队伍总共要打 5 + 8 + 7 + 2 + 7 = 27 场比赛。第二部分"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_dbdd4751-e4d3-4826-8bce-f4bd16ddf752.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"c2803645-5943-4c05-9cc7-dba73ad05d6e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7fd3855a-5e2c-4a2e-9325-3f28e95a3385","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这次的权值表示的是胜场的分配。第三部分"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_3dabf390-fb6c-4953-b0e3-692eb6aadf5e.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"0c4d7f78-f99d-4ac9-b113-2c2bb7530ec8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"aefc7380-d510-4f01-8e6b-9cb181a10bfa","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这时其中的权值表示每个队最多赢多少次，例如 NY 队目前 75 分，它最多只能赢一场。如果上述网络流的最大流大于等于比赛的总场次，所以存在一种方案能够分配所有胜场使得所有队的得分最多只有 76 分。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"cefb3422-b257-404e-a8eb-fb015d395a1b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面网络流我们建模为如下图"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"74d1c32c-1cd0-49ca-b2d3-ff144fdeaf39","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"015f3529-fc1a-425a-ae8c-966e055cf48e","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"11 19\n0 1 3\n0 2 8\n0 3 7\n0 4 2\n0 5 7\n1 6 3\n1 7 3\n2 6 8\n2 8 8\n3 6 7\n3 9 7\n4 7 2\n4 8 2\n5 7 7\n7 9 7\n6 10 1\n7 10 5\n8 10 7\n9 10 13","collabId":"151aa07c-1378-4c3e-bb8e-6e57225e21ba","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a92c550c-d75e-4002-a957-2561eeb45c12","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"现在我们用之前写的 MaxFlow 类来查看最大流是多少"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"73c32d6c-49ae-4ac6-8a41-44c5e89416d8","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"d0376c57-db2f-4b81-83ac-c24213db68a5","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"public class BaseBallSolution {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        DirectedWeightedGraph baseball = new DirectedWeightedGraph(\"g17.txt\");\n        MaxFlow maxflow = new MaxFlow(baseball, 0, 10);\n        System.out.println(maxflow.result());\n    }\n}","collabId":"463aed23-2cc4-4667-aff5-689ec97e0d29","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5630df39-717e-4851-82fa-8c1287a4f098","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"结果是"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"aa43a0f6-a4d5-4f9f-8ae0-bd174ec939ce","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"3bd3d235-904e-4de5-9c74-0116478cd058","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"26","collabId":"b2944ca5-8e03-4887-9826-050e202fa5f7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e6330e5d-0604-4675-8567-78e51d805cdc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"说明最大流为 26，小于 27，说明无法分配 27 场比赛使得所有队最多只能赢 76 场，这就意味着 Detroit 没有赢的可能了。"}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"数据结构","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:593","type":"doc","id":593}},{"label":"图结构","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:594","type":"doc","id":594}},{"label":"网络流与最大流","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:631","type":"doc","id":631}},{"label":"棒球比赛","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:634","type":"doc","id":634}}],"prevPage":{"title":"Edmonds-Karp 算法","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:633","type":"doc","id":633}},"nextPage":{"title":"匹配问题","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:635","type":"doc","id":635}},"createTime":1702133747160,"updateTime":1743303640563,"projectId":40},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1743303640563}}